WEBVTT

00:06:28.516 --> 00:06:32.836
without incurring
the disastrous impact of coal,

00:06:32.876 --> 00:06:36.276
i.e. health and
environmental consequences.

00:06:36.596 --> 00:06:40.636
Development and clean, breathable air

00:06:40.636 --> 00:06:43.396
must not be mutually exclusive.

00:06:43.756 --> 00:06:44.916
Thank you.